[en.DECISION_C15_ROYAL_PARADE]
Royal Parade

[en.DECISION_C15_ROYAL_PARADE_desc]
The members of the royal family will inspect various places in the Crystal Empire, care about the ponies’ livelihood, and thus improve the reputation of the royal family among the ponies.

[zh.DECISION_C15_ROYAL_PARADE]
皇室检阅

[zh.DECISION_C15_ROYAL_PARADE_desc]
水晶帝国皇室成员将对水晶帝国各个地方进行巡查，关心民生，以此提高皇室在民众中的声望。
